{
  "id": "E255",
  "title": "You’d Better Take the High-Speed Rail",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-09-16",
  "synopsis": "Ben wants to travel in China and Lili gives him some suggestions.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/833/b282c625fe43647fa2d4f7f759ae0955b19821e0.mp3?1535360244",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你最好坐高铁去\n\n本：我打算明年在国内旅游，你觉得我去哪里好？\n丽丽：我觉得你可以去云南。那里天气很好，风景也很漂亮。\n本：你觉得我什么时候去好？ \n丽丽：最好春天去，那时云南到处都是花。 \n本：你觉得我怎么去好？ \n丽丽：你最好坐高铁去，一路上的风景也很美。 \n本：你觉得我们一起去怎么样？\n丽丽：呃，我太忙了。我觉得你最好自己去。",
    "traditional": "你最好坐高鐵去\n\n本：我打算明年在國內旅遊，你覺得我去哪裏好？\n麗麗：我覺得你可以去雲南。那裡天氣很好，風景也很漂亮。\n本：你覺得我什麼時候去好？ \n麗麗：最好春天去，那時雲南到處都是花。 \n本：你覺得我怎麼去好？ \n麗麗：你最好坐高鐵去，一路上的風景也很美。 \n本：你覺得我們一起去怎麼樣？\n麗麗：呃，我太忙了。我覺得你最好自己去。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You’d better take the high-speed rail"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：我打算明年在国内旅游，你觉得我去哪里好？",
      "traditional": "本：我打算明年在國內旅遊，你覺得我去哪裏好？",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ dǎ suàn míng nián zài guó nèi lǚ yóu nǐ jué de wǒ qù nǎ lǐ hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I plan to travel in China next year, where do you think I should go?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我觉得你可以去云南。那里天气很好，风景也很漂亮。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我覺得你可以去雲南。那裡天氣很好，風景也很漂亮。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ jué de nǐ kě yǐ qù yún nán nà lǐ tiān qì hěn hǎo fēng jǐng yě hěn piào liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I think you can go to Yunnan. The weather there is very nice and the scenery is beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：你觉得我什么时候去好？",
      "traditional": "本：你覺得我什麼時候去好？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ jué de wǒ shén me shí hou qù hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": " \n",
      "traditional": " \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: When do you think I should go there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：最好春天去，那时云南到处都是花。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：最好春天去，那時雲南到處都是花。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zuì hǎo chūn tiān qù nà shí yún nán dào chù dōu shì huā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": " \n",
      "traditional": " \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: You’d better go there in the spring. Then there are flowers everywhere in Yunnan."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：你觉得我怎么去好？",
      "traditional": "本：你覺得我怎麼去好？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ jué de wǒ zěn me qù hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": " \n",
      "traditional": " \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: How do you think I should go there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你最好坐高铁去，一路上的风景也很美。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你最好坐高鐵去，一路上的風景也很美。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ zuì hǎo zuò gāo tiě qù yí lù shang de fēng jǐng yě hěn měi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": " \n",
      "traditional": " \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: You’d better go there by high-speed rail. The scenery on the way is also very beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：你觉得我们一起去怎么样？",
      "traditional": "本：你覺得我們一起去怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ jué de wǒ men yì qǐ qù zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: How about we go together?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "丽丽：呃，我太忙了。我觉得你最好自己去。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：呃，我太忙了。我覺得你最好自己去。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì è wǒ tài máng le wǒ jué de nǐ zuì hǎo zì jǐ qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Eek, I’m very busy. I think you’d better go there by yourself."
    }
  ],
