      "You’d better take the high-speed rail",
      "",
      "Ben: I plan to travel in China next year, where do you think I should go?",
      "",
      "Lili: I think you can go to Yunnan. The weather there is very nice and the scenery is beautiful.",
      "",
      "Ben: When do you think I should go there?",
      "",
      "Lili: You’d better go there in the spring. Then there are flowers everywhere in Yunnan.",
      "",
      "Ben: How do you think I should go there?",
      "",
      "Lili: You’d better go there by high-speed rail. The scenery on the way is also very beautiful.",
      "",
      "Ben: How about we go together?",
      "",
